This page provides a list of the FHIR artifacts defined as part of this implementation guide.


Structures: Resource Profiles {% capture grouping_desc %}These define constraints on FHIR resources for systems conforming to this implementation guide.{% endcapture %}
    {{ grouping_desc | markdownify}}





               Genomic TRF Questionnaire Response

            {% capture desc %}A completed TRF/AOE response with explicit order provenance.{% endcapture %}
{{ desc | markdownify}}




               Genomic TRF Specimen

            {% capture desc %}A specimen collected or retrieved to fulfill a genomic test order.{% endcapture %}
{{ desc | markdownify}}




               Genomic TRF Study

            {% capture desc %}A genomic study initiated to fulfill a genomic test order.{% endcapture %}
{{ desc | markdownify}}




               Genomic Test Order

            {% capture desc %}A ServiceRequest used to authorize one independently actionable genomic testing service.{% endcapture %}
{{ desc | markdownify}}





Structures: Extension Definitions {% capture grouping_desc %}These define constraints on FHIR data types for systems conforming to this implementation guide.{% endcapture %}
    {{ grouping_desc | markdownify}}





               Order Detail Parameter (R6 Pre-adoption)

            {% capture desc %}Structured key-value parameters for order details. This extension pre-adopts the R6 ServiceRequest.orderDetail.parameter structure to enable computable order instructions in R4. Each instance represents one parameter with a code and a typed value.{% endcapture %}
{{ desc | markdownify}}





Terminology: Value Sets {% capture grouping_desc %}These define sets of codes used by systems conforming to this implementation guide.{% endcapture %}
    {{ grouping_desc | markdownify}}





               Genomic TRF Order Category ValueSet

            {% capture desc %}Permitted high-level genomic requisition categories.{% endcapture %}
{{ desc | markdownify}}





Terminology: Code Systems {% capture grouping_desc %}These define new code systems used by systems conforming to this implementation guide.{% endcapture %}
    {{ grouping_desc | markdownify}}





               Genomic TRF Order Category

            {% capture desc %}High-level order categories used in the Genomic TRF IG.{% endcapture %}
{{ desc | markdownify}}





Example: Example Instances {% capture grouping_desc %}These are example instances that show what data produced and consumed by systems conforming with this implementation guide might look like.{% endcapture %}
